OL,3,AArgentina to file criminal case against
OL,4,Aoil company operating in Falklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FSovereignty of the archipelago remains
OL,7,Fdisputed between the UK and Argentina
OL,8,Fmore than 40 years after a British
OL,9,Fmilitary task force ejected Argentine
OL,10,Fforces which had invaded the territory
OL,11,Fin 1982.
